<title>UK: BBL Intl Finance sets 700 million Dkr bond.</title>
<headline>BBL Intl Finance sets 700 million Dkr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BBL INTERNATIONAL FINANCE SA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BBL SA</p>
<p> AMT    700 MLN DKR   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    20.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  63.5	PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/=     DENOMS (K) 10-50     GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
